# Scratch renders stay out of git: this directory fills with intermediate
# segments, raw screen recordings and test cuts on every run.
*.wav
*.mp4
*.webm
*.mp3

# ...but renders/ is the exception. Those are the FINISHED masters, and they
# are irreplaceable: they were made in a sandbox whose disk does not survive a
# restart, and the raw recordings behind them are already gone. Losing them
# means re-shooting and re-cutting from nothing. See renders/README.md.
!renders/
!renders/*.mp4
!renders/*.png
